# System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph External
        Radio[Radio Module]
        Signal[Signal Module]
        Camera[Camera/Media]
        REST[REST API]
        Plugins[Plugins]
    end

    subgraph Core["Tactical Core"]
        Engine[Event Engine]
        Pipeline[Pipeline]
        Bus[Event Bus]
        Registry[Registry]
        History[Event History]
    end

    subgraph Stages["Pipeline Stages"]
        V[Validation]
        E[Enrichment]
        P[Persistence]
        H[History]
        B[Broadcast]
        D[Dispatch]
        AI[AI]
        PL[Plugins]
    end

    subgraph Output
        WS[WebSocket]
        Dashboard[Dashboard]
        AI_Engine[AI Engine]
        ExtPlugins[External Plugins]
    end

    Radio --> Engine
    Signal --> Engine
    Camera --> Engine
    REST --> Engine
    Plugins --> Engine

    Engine --> Pipeline
    Pipeline --> V
    V --> E
    E --> P
    P --> H
    H --> B
    B --> D
    D --> AI
    AI --> PL

    Engine --> Bus
    Engine --> Registry
    Engine --> History

    B --> WS
    WS --> Dashboard

    D --> ExtPlugins

    PL --> ExtPlugins
    AI --> AI_Engine
```

## Legend
- External modules publish events to Event Engine
- Event Engine processes through Pipeline
- Pipeline stages operate independently
- Event Bus distributes to subscribers
- All events stored in History
